        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will play the role of a super warrior who hates evil and comes to a city controlled by gangs. You will encounter the besieged mayor and embark on the path of upholding justice and eliminating evil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat countless enemies, constantly explore, collect coins, purchase supplies and equipment, constantly become stronger, and become the hero of the entire city.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A refreshing 2D action fighting game that combines fun gameplay from other types of games such as <strong>Metroidvania , 2D Platformer Game</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dual combat resources: Energy and Rage, along with a wide variety of skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accepts input buffering, making it easy for beginners to pick up and play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No collision damage, automatic health regeneration, and a tough, resilient hero who's hard to defeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple abilities available from the start, ensuring a frustration-free experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse mechanics: Combos, blocking, dodging, grabbing, throw techniques, and transformation.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will play the role of a super warrior who hates evil and comes to a city controlled by gangs. You will encounter the besieged mayor and embark on the path of upholding justice and eliminating evil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat countless enemies, constantly explore, collect coins, purchase supplies and equipment, constantly become stronger, and become the hero of the entire city.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A refreshing 2D action fighting game that combines fun gameplay from other types of games such as <strong>Metroidvania , 2D Platformer Game</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dual combat resources: Energy and Rage, along with a wide variety of skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accepts input buffering, making it easy for beginners to pick up and play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No collision damage, automatic health regeneration, and a tough, resilient hero who's hard to defeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple abilities available from the start, ensuring a frustration-free experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse mechanics: Combos, blocking, dodging, grabbing, throw techniques, and transformation.</p>",
        "short_description": "Transform into a powerful superhero and rescue a city ruled by the Dark Empire. A variety of skills, fist to flesh impact, ultimate smooth combo, bring you a unique gaming experience.",
